<title>UK: BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of first leg matches in</p>
<p>the men's EuroLeague basketball elimination round on Wednesday;</p>
<p>In Villeurbanne:  Villeurbanne (France) 97 Estudiantes</p>
<p>Madrid (Spain) 74 (haltime 43-33)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Villeurbanne - Alain Diguebeu 24, Delaney Rudd 13, Brian</p>
<p>Howard 11</p>
<p>Madrid - Harper Williams 14, Ignacio de Miguel 10</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,600</p>
<p>In Bologna: Teamsystem Bologna (Italy) 73 Sevilla (Spain) 70</p>
<p>(46-35)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Bologna - Myers 26, Murdock 18, McRae 10</p>
<p>Sevilla - Anderson 28, Perez 10, Frank 8, Doblado 8</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,771</p>
